  // Each profile lists picks in priority order. A pick fills one slot with the first
  // spell in "Any" that you have learned, have not excluded, and is not already in the
  // set. Numbers are the Blue Magic Spellbook numbers, the same in every language.
  // Picks run until 24 slots are full; anything after that is ignored.
  //
  // "Fill" at the bottom tops up any slots still empty once a profile's picks run out,
  // so knowing plenty of spells never leaves gaps. A profile can have its own "Fill"
  // list to replace the shared one.
